  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "ほかくれいは　ゼロ。　データぶそく。ある　たんけんきに　しるされた　せいぶつととくちょうが　いっちする。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "포획된 사례는 없으며 데이터도 부족하다. 어느 탐험기에 기록된 생물과 특징이 일치한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "無捕獲紀錄。資料不足。其特徵與某本探險記裡所記載的生物一致。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ses attributs correspondent à ceux d’une créature évoquée dans un récit d’exploration. On manque de données sur lui, car nul n’en a jamais attrapé.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Da es noch nie gefangen wurde, ist die Datenlage dürftig. Seine Merkmale decken sich mit einer in einem Expeditionsbericht beschriebenen Kreatur.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Nunca se había capturado uno, ergo los datos al respecto escasean. Su descripción coincide con la de una criatura mencionada en cierto diario.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Mancano dati su questo Pokémon, mai catturato in passato. La sua descrizione coincide con quella di una creatura citata in un certo diario di viaggio.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "No records exist of this Pokémon being caught. Data is lacking, but the Pokémon’s traits match up with a creature shown in an expedition journal.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "捕獲例は　ゼロ。　データ不足。ある　探検記に　記された　生物と特徴が　一致する。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "没有捕获记录。资料不足。其特征与某本探险记中所记载的生物一致。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Nunca se había capturado uno, ergo los datos al respecto escasean. Su descripción coincide con la de una criatura mencionada en cierto diario.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "オカルトざっしの　きじにあった１まんねん　いきた　レアコイルの　すがたにやや　にている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "오컬트 잡지 기사에 나왔던 1만 년을 산 레어코일의 모습과 약간 비슷하게 생겼다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "與超自然雜誌所報導的活了１萬年的三合一磁怪長得稍微有那麼一點相似。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il ressemble vaguement à un Magnéton qui aurait vécu 10 000 ans, selon un article paru dans une revue consacrée aux phénomènes paranormaux.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es hat gewisse Ähnlichkeit mit einem Magneton, das 10 000 Jahre lang lebte und in einem Artikel einer esoterischen Zeitschrift thematisiert wurde.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Su aspecto recuerda ligeramente a un supuesto Magneton que ha vivido 10 000 años y cuya imagen se publicó en una revista esotérica.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Somiglia vagamente a un Magneton vissuto per 10.000 anni di cui si parla in un articolo di una rivista di paranormale.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It slightly resembles a Magneton that lived for 10,000 years and was featured in an article in a paranormal magazine.",
